text.paragraph:


                     Pregnancy and Lactation

Advise patients to use fluocinolone acetonide oil on the smallest area of skin and for the shortest duration possible while pregnant or breastfeeding. Advise patients that are breastfeeding not to apply fluocinolone acetonide oil directly to the nipple and areola to avoid direct infant exposure [See Use in Specific Populations (8.1 and 8.2)
                     ].
